sequenceDiagram
  actor Analyst
  participant SOAR
  participant Policy
  actor Approver
  participant Connector
  participant Target
  Analyst->>SOAR: Request response action
  SOAR->>Policy: Evaluate scope/risk/criticality
  Policy-->>SOAR: Approval required
  SOAR->>Approver: Present exact action hash and evidence
  alt Approved
    Approver-->>SOAR: Approve with expiry
    SOAR->>Connector: Execute with idempotency key
    Connector->>Target: Provider API call
    Target-->>Connector: Result
    Connector-->>SOAR: Normalized result
    SOAR->>Policy: Verify post-condition
  else Rejected or expired
    Approver-->>SOAR: Reject/deny
    SOAR-->>Analyst: Create escalation task
  end
